                                "sense_id": "5f0ef041-0a67-3b0c-92cb-93f5834b1e22",
                                "text": "\"We thought everything was alright, then when Luke started to walk we noticed he got the wobbles, and they never left, eight months later he was diagnosed with A-T,\" she said."
