                                "sense_id": "da0b4867-6131-3a24-bfbd-0d1015f473c7",
                                "text": "You'd have to be impressed with the way the right is stuffing up the post-election transition into opposition. It had the wobbles from the start, electing Peter Dutton as its leader and promptly trying to soften his image."
